     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜をめぐって: around (a debate or conflict)",
     "texto": [
      "To say that a discussion or problem revolves around something: noun + **を めぐって**: **その もんだい を めぐって、 はげしい ぎろん が あります** (around that problem there is an intense debate).",
      "It is used a lot in news and analysis."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Sense of controversy",
     "texto": [
      "It expresses that there are several opinions rather than an agreement.",
      "That is why it usually goes with words like はげしい (intense) or ぎろん (debate)."
